msgid ""
"# Topographic Visualization\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This script returns a visualisation with green colours representing lowland "
"elevations and earth colours as mountainous elevations. The script uses "
"discrete classes rather than the continuous visualisations in the other DEM "
"layers.\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to set custom min and max values in the evalscript by "
"setting defaultVis to false and setting the min and max variables to the "
"desired values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info "
"[here.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-topographic/)"
msgstr ""
"# Topogrāfiska vizualizācija\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Šis skripts atgriež vizualizāciju, kurā zaļās krāsas attēlo zemienes "
"augstumus, bet zemes krāsas — kalnu augstumus. Skripts izmanto diskrētas "
"klases, nevis nepārtrauktās vizualizācijas, kas ir citos DEM slāņos.\n"
"\n"
"Evalscript ir iespējams iestatīt pielāgotas min un max vērtības, iestatot "
"defaultVis uz false un min un max mainīgajiem norādot vēlamās vērtības.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Vairāk informācijas "
"[šeit.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-topographic/)"

msgid ""
"# Color Visualization\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"This script returns a color visualization of a digital elevation model, "
"assigning continuous colors to the elevation borders.\n"
"\n"
"It is possible to set custom min and max values in the evalscript by "
"setting defaultVis to false and setting the min and max variables to the "
"desired values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"More info [here.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-color/)"
msgstr ""
"# Krāsu vizualizācija\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Šis skripts atgriež digitālā augstuma modeļa krāsu vizualizāciju, augstuma "
"robežām piešķirot nepārtrauktas krāsas.\n"
"\n"
"Evalscript ir iespējams iestatīt pielāgotas min un max vērtības, iestatot "
"defaultVis uz false un min un max mainīgajiem norādot vēlamās vērtības.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Vairāk informācijas "
"[šeit.](https://custom-scripts.sentinel-hub.com/dem/dem-color/)"

