#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"An evalscript (or \"custom script\") is a piece of Javascript code that "
"defines how the satellite data\n"
"should be processed by Sentinel Hub (one of the underlying services that "
"powers the Browser) and what values the\n"
"service should return.\n"
"Read more about custom scripts in our [tutorials](${ tutorial }) or use "
"already prepared scripts\n"
"for different collections from the [custom script repository](${ repo })."
msgstr ""
"Evalscript (jeb \"pielāgots skripts\") ir JavaScript koda fragments, kas "
"nosaka, kā Sentinel Hub (viens no pamatpakalpojumiem, kas nodrošina Browser "
"darbību) apstrādā satelīta datus\n"
"un kādas vērtības\n"
"pakalpojumam jāatgriež.\n"
"Lasiet vairāk par pielāgotajiem skriptiem mūsu [pamācībās](${ tutorial }) "
"vai izmantojiet jau sagatavotus skriptus\n"
"dažādām kolekcijām no [pielāgoto skriptu krātuves](${ repo })."

msgid ""
"Note: The **collection_id**, **spatial_extent**, **temporal_extent**, and "
"**advanced options** settings (e.g., mosaickingOrder, upsampling, "
"downsampling) are read-only. These values are updated automatically based "
"on your map navigation, date selection, collection choice, and advanced "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Piezīme: iestatījumi **collection_id**, **spatial_extent**, "
"**temporal_extent** un **advanced options** (piemēram, mosaickingOrder, "
"upsampling, downsampling) ir tikai lasāmi. Šīs vērtības tiek atjauninātas "
"automātiski, pamatojoties uz jūsu kartes navigāciju, datuma izvēli, "
"kolekcijas izvēli un papildu iestatījumiem."

