msgid ""
"The **WMS/WMTS panel** lets you add third-party map layers to Copernicus "
"Browser via a service **GetCapabilities URL**.\n"
"\n"
"To **add a service** - paste its GetCapabilities URL into the input field "
"and click the add button <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span> (or press Enter). The service and its layers appear "
"alongside the standard collections.\n"
"\n"
"Once a service is loaded, you can:\n"
"- View **service details** (description, access constraints and fees) - by "
"clicking on the info icon <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa "
"fa-info\"></i></span> next to the service name.\n"
"- **Select** a service - by clicking on its name; the active service is "
"marked with a checkmark and its layers are listed below.\n"
"- **Remove** a service - by clicking on the remove icon <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"In the layer list you can **search** layers by name, page through them with "
"the <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> and "
"<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span> "
"controls, and pick how many layers to show per page. Click a layer to "
"display it on the map. On the active layer, use **Add to** <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> to add it to the "
"**Compare** or **Pins** panels."
msgstr ""
"**WMS/WMTS panelis** ļauj pievienot trešo pušu karšu slāņus Copernicus "
"Browser, izmantojot pakalpojuma **GetCapabilities URL**.\n"
"\n"
"Lai **pievienotu pakalpojumu**, ielīmējiet tā GetCapabilities URL ievades "
"laukā un noklikšķiniet uz pievienošanas pogas <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fas fa-plus\"></i></span> (vai nospiediet Enter). Pakalpojums un tā "
"slāņi parādās līdzās standarta kolekcijām.\n"
"\n"
"Kad pakalpojums ir ielādēts, varat:\n"
"- Skatīt **pakalpojuma informāciju** (apraksts, piekļuves ierobežojumi un "
"maksa) — noklikšķinot uz informācijas ikonas <span class=\"icon\"><i "
"class=\"fa fa-info\"></i></span> blakus pakalpojuma nosaukumam.\n"
"- **Izvēlēties** pakalpojumu — noklikšķinot uz tā nosaukuma; aktīvais "
"pakalpojums ir atzīmēts ar atzīmi, un tā slāņi ir uzskaitīti zemāk.\n"
"- **Noņemt** pakalpojumu — noklikšķinot uz noņemšanas ikonas <span "
"class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-trash\"></i></span>.\n"
"\n"
"Slāņu sarakstā varat **meklēt** slāņus pēc nosaukuma, pāriet starp lappusēm "
"ar vadīklām <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-left\"></i></span> un <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-chevron-right\"></i></span> un izvēlēties, cik slāņu rādīt vienā "
"lappusē. Noklikšķiniet uz slāņa, lai to attēlotu kartē. Aktīvajam slānim "
"izmantojiet **Pievienot** <span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fas "
"fa-plus\"></i></span>, lai pievienotu to **Salīdzināšanas** vai **Atzīmju** "
"paneļiem."

#, javascript-format
